  "prefLabel": "Nur 802.03 Duty of Students",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 802.03 Duty of Students. While receiving education through a board-approved medication administration education program, a student shall comply with all of the regulations and requirements of the sponsoring institution and of the program.\n\nSource. #7742, eff 8-13-02; ss by #8873, eff 4-24-07 (formerly Nur 903.03); ss by #10303, eff 3-22-13; ss by #10572, eff 4-17-14",
